^{:go/end 165} (go/method isValidStatelessResetToken "isValidStatelessResetToken reports whether the given reset token is\nassociated with a non-retired connection ID which we have used.\n" ^bool [^{:tag (* connIDState)} s ^statelessResetToken resetToken]
